 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published (no section headers). The list opens with an unlabelled group — Hoth Echo Command Center, Twilek Advisor, IAO — that reads as the starting cards; starting.card is set to Hoth: Echo Command Center (War Room), and since the group is not labelled as starting, no starting Interrupt/Effect is set.",
  "The line 'Executor Bossk in Bus' is two cards run together: dested Executor and Bossk In Hound's Tooth (1 each).",
  "Posted 'CC docking bay' dested the Dark Cloud City docking bay Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) (Platform 327 is the Light one); 'Tatooine DB' Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'spaceport DB' Spaceport Docking Bay; '3rd Marker'/'North Ridge'/'Ice plains'/'Mountains'/'Wampa Cave' the Hoth marker sites; 'IAO' Imperial Arrest Order.",
  "Posted 'EPP Vader' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'GMT' Grand Moff Tarkin; 'LT. Cabbal' Lieutenant Cabbel; 'DS-3'/'DS-4' DS-61-3/DS-61-4; 'Sgt. Major Bursk' Sergeant Major Bursk; 'Blizard 1' Blizzard 1; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'Vaders Shuttle' Vader's Personal Shuttle; 'Master move' Masterful Move; 'I'd just as soon kiss a wookie' I'd Just As Soon Kiss A Wookiee; 'Responsibilty of Command' Responsibility Of Command. Walker Garrison is posted among the Interrupts.",
  "Battle Order is the Special Edition Effect (no Defensive Shields in November 1999)."
